<section id="Sx7" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">F. Visualizations</h2>

<div id="Sx7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present additional qualitative results to compare Diff<sup id="Sx7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_sup">2</sup>I2P with the baseline method, 2D3D-MATR <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">25</a>]</cite>. For clarity, we visualize the correspondences extracted by both methods, selecting the top 500 correspondences with the highest feature matching scores. <a href="#Sx7.F10" title="In F. Visualizations ‣ Diff2I2P: Differentiable Image-to-Point Cloud Registration with Diffusion Prior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Fig.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> illustrates the results on the 7-Scenes <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib13" title="" class="ltx_ref">13</a>]</cite> dataset, while <a href="#Sx7.F11" title="In F. Visualizations ‣ Diff2I2P: Differentiable Image-to-Point Cloud Registration with Diffusion Prior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Fig.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> highlights the results on the RGB-D Scenes V2 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite> dataset. The findings show that Diff<sup id="Sx7.p1.1.2" class="ltx_sup">2</sup>I2P extracts more accurate correspondences, delivering robust and superior scene-agnostic registration performance.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Sx7.F10" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2507.06651v1/qualitative_7scenes.png" id="Sx7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:685/868;" width="685" height="868" alt="Refer to caption">
<br class="ltx_break ltx_break">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Sx7.F10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 10</span>: </span><span id="Sx7.F10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Correspondence visualizations on 7-scenes</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Sx7.F11" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2507.06651v1/qualitative_rgbd.png" id="Sx7.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:685/869;" width="685" height="869" alt="Refer to caption">
